@startuml uc_kesiapsiagaan_iot
left to right direction
title SIGAP — Use Case: Kesiapsiagaan & IoT (Indikator + Sirine)

actor "Warga Desa" as Warga
actor "Admin / Operator" as Admin
actor "Perangkat IoT\n(Indikator + Sirine)" as IoT

rectangle "Sistem SIGAP" {
  usecase "Lihat Info Kesiapsiagaan" as UC3
  usecase "Terima Notifikasi Level Alert" as UC4
  usecase "Evaluasi Rule Threshold" as UC_rule
  usecase "Kirim Level ke Perangkat IoT" as UC11
  usecase "Verifikasi Level & Putuskan Tindakan" as UC8
  usecase "Trigger Sirine" as UC9
  usecase "Notifikasi Operator" as UC_notif
}

Warga --> UC3
Warga --> UC4

UC_rule .> UC11 : <<include>>
UC11 --> IoT

IoT --> UC8 : device menampilkan level
UC8 .> UC_notif : <<include>>
Admin --> UC8

UC9 .> UC8 : <<extend>>
note right of UC9
  Extension point: hanya aktif
  jika level = Kuning atau Merah.
  Level Hijau tidak membuka opsi
  ini (safeguard by design).
end note
Admin --> UC9
UC9 --> IoT : bunyikan sirine

note right of UC_notif
  TBD - kanal notifikasi ke operator
  belum ditentukan, berpotensi
  bersinggungan dengan larangan
  notifikasi WhatsApp untuk warga
  (PRD 3.2 vs 7.1).
end note

note bottom of UC11
  TBD - protokol komunikasi
  platform -> device belum final
  (kandidat: MQTT / REST polling).
  Lihat PRD 4 Tech Stack.
end note

@enduml